# WFORMTM.KEY - a record deleted under the dialog (WF_GONE) and a session
# that ended under it (WF_QUIT), which its save finds out (SHIFT-F9);
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTM.SNP.  WFORMTT's F9 meets one that ended before
# the dialog opens.
K F8
S GONEOPEN
T C
K ENTER
S GONEBOX
K ENTER
S GONE
K SHIFT-F9
T C
K ENTER
S ENDBOX
K ENTER
S ENDED
